<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex (GPT-6), independent Tibetan-first proposal; no human or semantic approval is implied. The mutually exclusive technical expression phan tshun spangs 'gal owns the complete closing definition at d3; the independent dngos 'gal owns directly incompatible. HGM glossary supports both, but the allocation is checked from this argument. chu is banked once at the first water; the second English water repeats its single Tibetan noun. la sogs pa, gsum po and gnyis po are omitted because numeration and the closing enumeration are recast across the other two and repeated qualities; yin and the final reason/copula are omitted as distributed. No separate exponent is falsely asserted absent. The C16 parallel adds a following heading; this C05 row has none.</div>
